{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Death Forest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive the horrors of the Suicide Forest?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a remote forest where the trees stretch endlessly and shadows dance with forgotten memories, fear becomes your only companion.<br>Here, the boundary between <strong>reality and nightmare</strong> begins to dissolve.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Descent into Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>The Death Forest</strong>, you are alone \u2014 or so it seems. Whispers haunt the wind. Shadows shift. Your mind begins to betray you.<br>Experience a journey through <strong>psychological horror</strong>, where <strong>hallucinations</strong>, paranoia, and fear twist your every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Is Not Guaranteed</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>intricate puzzles</strong> to unravel the forest\u2019s dark secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>limited tools</strong> with care \u2014 every action can mean life or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide. Move quietly. Stay alert.</strong> Something is watching.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic lighting</strong> and visual effects heighten the tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D spatial audio</strong> surrounds you with every unsettling whisper and crackling branch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the forest\u2019s truth... or become another lost soul trapped in its legend?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577080?t=1753898861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577080?t=1753898861","capsule